or a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins</strong> → Basic currency used to upgrade your Oroboro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocket</strong> → Takes out an opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield</strong> → Shields oroboro from enemies for a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SlowTime</strong> → Slows time for a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the eternal cycle… or will chaos consume you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donwload Oroboros now and prepare to face infinity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019450/extras/f15755ec5e37b41b38690ecdfbf9adaa.avif?t=1764936857\" width=1138 height=533 /></span></p>", "short_description": "OROBOROS is an arcade-action game where, as you fight to complete your cycle, enemies and adventure are dragged onto you; packed with explosions, bursting with excitement, and loaded with challenge. Eating your own tail has never been this hard.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, German, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019450/f8aa4cd7493d9bbd59af90878ed02824d56855aa/header.jpg?t=1764936857", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019450/eba7b56de36aefcd45ef06341ebfe08968dedde4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764936857", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019450/eba7b56de36aefcd45ef06341ebfe08968dedde4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764936857", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro